From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:16:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/17] arm64: dts: qcom: iceland: reboot to the boot loader
 through PSCI

Add the PSCI SYSTEM_RESET2 reboot mode for "bootloader" with the value
Qualcomm uses on Kaanapali (reset type 0x80010001, cookie 2, from
"arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali: add reboot-mode support" by Xin Liu), and
the psci label it needs in kaanapali.dtsi.

The PMIC SDAM reboot reason (mode-bootloader = 2) stays and is still
written; the OnePlus Pad 4's boot loader ignores it after a cold reset
from Linux and boots the default slot. The EDL mode of the MTP / QRD
boards is left out on purpose, and recovery keeps the SDAM reason.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260529-psci_sys_reset-dt-changes-for-pakala-v1-2-7c32161cf50b@oss.qualcomm.com/
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts     | 13 +++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi             |  2 +-
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
index 5a044fb69f91..5ed53e5b6547 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
@@ -2112,6 +2112,19 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&psci {
+	/*
+	 * SYSTEM_RESET2 vendor reset for "reboot bootloader" (Qualcomm's
+	 * Kaanapali value): the boot loader stops in fastboot, which it does
+	 * not do for the SDAM reboot reason after a cold reset from Linux.
+	 * Recovery stays with the SDAM reason (pmk8850.dtsi); no EDL mode.
+	 * psci.vendor_reset=0 returns to the plain reset.
+	 */
+	reboot-mode {
+		mode-bootloader = <0x80010001 0x2>;
+	};
+};
+
 &q6apmbedai {
 	#address-cells = <1>;
 	#size-cells = <0>;
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi
index f39f3dac2a08..6e6b69fe1319 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali.dtsi
@@ -352,7 +352,7 @@
 		interrupts = <GIC_PPI 7 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_LOW>;
 	};
 
-	psci {
+	psci: psci {
 		compatible = "arm,psci-1.0";
 		method = "smc";
 
